{"type":"assistant","message":{"model":"claude-opus-4-6","id":"msg_01KZ5sw95RvBE3Wcj5g2GHnq","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"The user wants me to generate detailed imagined experiment data for the \"worst\" tier for every \"planned\" experiment in the experiment_plan. Let me identify all planned experiments:\n\n1. plan_006 - Gradient conflict analysis on v7 (3 epoch checkpoints)\n2. plan_007 - Attention heatmap visualization\n3. plan_009 - Llama-3.1-8B Phase 1 GAR degradation diagnosis\n4. plan_010 - Llama-3.1-8B ThreadGate v7 training\n\n\n5. plan_011 - Llama-3.1-8B LoRA-only training\n6. plan_012 - Llama-3.1-8B 3-way eval\n7. plan_013 - Llama-3.1-8B gradient conflict analysis\n8. plan_014 - Downstream task sanity check\n9. plan_015 - Statistical significance analysis (bootstrap CI)\n10. plan_016 - Exposure-bias mitigation test\n\nFor the \"worst\" tier scenario, I'm assuming minimal GAR degradation on Llama-3 base (raw drop under 30%) or potentially no measurable degradation at all, which would represent the least favorable outcomes for the experiments. pattern 不同 (非单调下降)\n- Llama-3 训练-推理 gap <5x, 或 gating 在 Llama 上有 1-5pp 增量\n- 梯度冲突在 Llama 上不显著 (cos_sim 接近 0 或正值为主)\n- Scheduled sampling 不缩小 gap (或缩小 <20%)\n- 一个或多个 bootstrap CI 不包含 0\n\n现在我在整理最坏情况下的关键指标范围，包括相对性能下降、训练推理差距比、梯度相似度、缓解策略的有效性以及预期评分。这些数据点定义了我们对 Llama-3 表现的基准。关键的叙述转向是将其重新框架化为架构相关的分析，其中 Qwen 和 Llama 的对比成为核心洞察。\n\n现在我开始为计划中的每个实验构建详细预测，特别是针对 plan_006 中的 Qwen 梯度冲突分析，这部分已经从现有数据中部分了解。\n\nQwen 的数据本身不会改变（梯度冲突指标已经在框架文档中引用），所以这个实验应该仍然显示相同的 Qwen 特定结果。对于 Qwen 实验组（plan_006、plan_007、plan_014、plan_015、plan_016），最坏情况主要影响 Llama 交叉验证和缓解实验，但某些 Qwen 实验也受影响，特别是 plan_015 中的 bootstrap CI，其中最坏情况表明一个或多个 bootstrap CI 不包含 0，这削弱了对零假设的统计支持。\n\nplan_016 的缓解实验中，最坏情况表明计划采样无法缩小差距。\n\n现在逐个检查每个实验：plan_006 应该生成已经引用的数据，Qwen 的余弦相似度在各个 epoch 中保持负值，幅度比持续增加；plan_007 的注意力热力图可视化涵盖 4 个模型、3 个对话和 28 层，在最坏情况下 Qwen 的热力图应该显示相同的模式，但可视化可能不够清晰；plan_009 中 Llama 第一阶段的 GAR 诊断在最坏情况下显示原始下降 10-30% 且非单调，Llama 表现出更弱的 GAR 退化。\n\nplan_010 中 Llama TG v7 训练的 GAR 可能略有改善，推理 GAR 也好于 Qwen，差距比仅为 2-5 倍而非 30 倍；plan_012 的三向评估显示 TG 相比纯 LoRA 有 3-8 个百分点的 GAR 优势，这实际上削弱了通用性的论断；plan_013 中 Llama 的梯度冲突表现出接近零或正的余弦相似度和仅 1.5-4 倍的幅度比，NTP-GAR 竞争要弱得多。\n\nplan_014 的下游任务检查在最坏情况下 GAR 可能与下游性能的相关性不强；plan_015 的自助法置信区间中有一个或多个不包含 0，削弱了零收益的论断。\n\n对于 plan_016 的缓解策略（计划采样），差距缩减因子仅为 0.8-1.2，基本没有缩减甚至略有恶化，缓解后的推理 GAR 仍然很低。","signature":""}],"stop_reason":null,"stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":2,"cache_creation_input_tokens":20039,"cache_read_input_tokens":11841,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":20039},"output_tokens":27,"service_tier":"standard","inference_geo":"not_available"},"diagnostics":null,"context_management":null},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"5f656fc9-3579-461d-a490-ffcd13e5ba84","uuid":"91130c6a-379f-4746-a015-736a60dce169"}
{"type":"assistant","message":{"model":"claude-opus-4-6","id":"msg_01KZ5sw95RvBE3Wcj5g2GHnq","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"text","text":"```yaml\ntier: worst\nnarrative_guidance: >\n  Reframe 为 'Why does gating fail on Qwen but not Llama? An architecture-dependent analysis of\n  NTP-auxiliary loss interaction'。核心 angle 转向两个架构的对比本身成为 insight——什么架构特性使\n  Qwen 更脆弱（GQA head 结构差异、layer norm 位置、attention pattern 分布）。SP1 从 '普遍现象的\n  首个量化' 收窄为 'architecture-dependent vulnerability 的首个量化 + 对比分析'。30x gap 仍是\n  Qwen 上的有效 finding，但不再 claim 普遍性。Mitigation 负面结果变为 'exposure bias 不是唯一因素'\n  的证据，引入 architecture-specific confound。仍投 EMNLP Findings（不降级 venue），但叙事从\n  universal mechanism 转为 contrastive case study。需追加 Llama 的详细 gate profile + attention\n  pattern 对比分析，写作量增加。预期 review score 2.5-3.0。\n\nimagined_experiments:\n  - name: \"Qwen v7 Gradient Conflict Analysis (3 checkpoints)\"\n    plan_id: \"plan_006\"\n    description: >\n      对 v7 训练的 3 个 epoch checkpoint 提取 NTP 与 GAR loss 在 gate 参数上的梯度，\n      计算逐层 cosine similarity 和 magnitude ratio。Qwen 数据本身不受 worst tier 影响\n      （已在 Qwen 上观测到强梯度冲突），但在 worst tier 叙事下，这些数据将被 reframe 为\n      Qwen-specific vulnerability 而非 universal mechanism。\n    expected_results:\n      epoch0_cos_sim_mean: -0.089\n      epoch0_cos_sim_negative_layer_pct: 0.79\n      epoch0_mag_ratio_mean: 7.5\n      epoch1_cos_sim_mean: -0.061\n      epoch1_cos_sim_negative_layer_pct: 0.71\n      epoch1_mag_ratio_mean: 11.2\n      epoch2_cos_sim_mean: -0.042\n      epoch2_cos_sim_negative_layer_pct: 0.67\n      epoch2_mag_ratio_mean: 14.7\n      L27_mag_ratio_epoch0: 135\n      L27_mag_ratio_epoch2: 1139\n      layers_with_persistent_negative_cos_sim: 18\n    result_rationale: >\n      Qwen-2.5-7B 的梯度冲突数据已在 D014/D015 中间接观测并在 paper_framing 中引用。\n      此实验是正式化提取。Qwen 的 GQA 结构（28 层，grouped query attention with fewer KV heads）\n      使得 NTP 梯度在 gate 参数上的投影与 GAR 梯度方向持续冲突。cos_sim 从 -0.089 缓解到\n      -0.042 不是因为两个 loss 调和，而是 GAR 信号被边缘化（mag_ratio 从 7.5x 涨到 14.7x）。\n      L27 的 mag_ratio 从 135x 暴涨到 1139x 说明最后几层 NTP 完全主导 gate 学习。这些数字\n      在 worst tier 下不变，但叙事角色从 \"universal gradient competition\" 降级为\n      \"Qwen-specific gradient competition\"，与 Llama 的弱冲突形成对比。\n    tables:\n      - name: \"Table: NTP-GAR Gradient Conflict Across Training (Qwen-2.5-7B)\"\n        columns: [\"Checkpoint\", \"cos_sim (mean±std)\", \"% layers cos<0\", \"mag_ratio (mean)\", \"mag_ratio (L27)\", \"Interpretation\"]\n        rows:\n          - [\"Epoch 0 (gs 2650)\", \"-0.089 ± 0.12\", \"79%\", \"7.5x\", \"135x\", \"Strong directional conflict, moderate NTP dominance\"]\n          - [\"Epoch 1 (gs 5300)\", \"-0.061 ± 0.11\", \"71%\", \"11.2x\", \"487x\", \"Conflict weakening as GAR signal marginalized\"]\n          - [\"Epoch 2 (gs 7950)\", \"-0.042 ± 0.10\", \"67%\", \"14.7x\", \"1139x\", \"GAR effectively silenced; NTP fully controls gates\"]\n    figures_description:\n      - \"Fig: 28-layer heatmap of cos_sim across 3 checkpoints. Color: blue=negative (conflict), red=positive (aligned). Shows persistent blue in layers 3-14 (early-mid), with layers 25-27 deep blue across all checkpoints. Upper layers transition from blue to near-zero, indicating GAR gradient vanishing rather than alignment.\"\n      - \"Fig: Per-layer mag_ratio bar chart at epoch 2. Logarithmic y-axis. Layers 25-27 show extreme ratios (100-1139x), layers 0-5 moderate (5-15x). Demonstrates NTP dominance is strongest in final layers where attention routing decisions matter most.\"\n    analysis: >\n      Qwen 的梯度冲突证据仍然是 valid finding。在 worst tier 下，关键 reframing 是：为什么\n      Llama 不展现同样程度的冲突？假说：Qwen 的 GQA 结构中 KV heads 较少（7 groups vs Llama\n      的 8 groups），attention 参数共享程度更高，使得 NTP 和 GAR 在相同参数空间上的竞争更激烈。\n      这个对比本身成为新的 insight，但也意味着 claim 必须从 \"NTP-GAR competition is a fundamental\n      obstacle\" 收窄为 \"NTP-GAR competition severity is architecture-dependent\"。\n\n  - name: \"Attention Heatmap Visualization (4 models x 3 convs x 28 layers)\"\n    plan_id: \"plan_007\"\n    description: >\n      对 4 个模型（Base/TG/UG/LoRA-only）在 3 段 held-out 对话上提取 28 层的 attention\n      pattern，可视化 goal token attention 随 turn 的变化。\n    expected_results:\n      base_turn1_goal_attn_mean: 0.042\n      base_turn10_goal_attn_mean: 0.008\n      tg_turn1_goal_attn_mean: 0.039\n      tg_turn10_goal_attn_mean: 0.009\n      ug_turn1_goal_attn_mean: 0.041\n      ug_turn10_goal_attn_mean: 0.008\n      lora_turn1_goal_attn_mean: 0.040\n      lora_turn10_goal_attn_mean: 0.009\n      cross_model_attn_pattern_correlation: 0.97\n      layers_with_visible_gate_effect: 0\n    result_rationale: >\n      推理时 gate 值均在 0.93-0.98 范围（NF3: 2-7% attenuation），对 attention pattern 的\n      实际影响微乎其微。因此 4 个模型的 attention heatmap 在视觉上几乎不可区分——均展现相同的\n      goal attention 衰减模式。TG 和 UG 的 gate 在推理时接近 identity，无法将训练时学到的\n      attention pattern 迁移到自回归生成上下文。LoRA fine-tuning 改变的是 NTP 相关的 attention\n      分布，不影响 goal-specific attention。Base 模型有更高 PPL（4.23 vs 2.63），但 goal\n      attention 衰减模式相同。在 worst tier 下，这些 Qwen 可视化仍有效，但需要与 Llama 的\n      heatmap 形成对比——Llama 可能展现不同的 baseline attention 分布模式。\n    tables:\n      - name: \"Table: Goal Token Attention by Model and Turn (Qwen-2.5-7B, averaged across layers and conversations)\"\n        columns: [\"Model\", \"Turn 1\", \"Turn 5\", \"Turn 10\", \"Turn 15\", \"Turn 20\", \"Relative Drop (T1→T20)\"]\n        rows:\n          - [\"Base\", \"0.042\", \"0.018\", \"0.008\", \"0.006\", \"0.005\", \"88.1%\"]\n          - [\"ThreadGate\", \"0.039\", \"0.017\", \"0.009\", \"0.007\", \"0.005\", \"87.2%\"]\n          - [\"Uniform Gate\", \"0.041\", \"0.018\", \"0.008\", \"0.006\", \"0.005\", \"87.8%\"]\n          - [\"LoRA-only\", \"0.040\", \"0.017\", \"0.009\", \"0.006\", \"0.005\", \"87.5%\"]\n    figures_description:\n      - \"Fig: 4x1 panel of attention heatmaps (rows=28 layers, cols=20 turns) for each model. Color intensity = goal token attention weight. All four panels visually identical: bright column at turn 1 fading to near-black by turn 10+. No discernible gate effect in TG/UG panels.\"\n      - \"Fig: Layer-aggregated goal attention curves (4 models overlaid) for one representative conversation. Lines overlap almost perfectly (cross-model correlation 0.97), confirming gating has zero impact on inference-time attention patterns.\"\n    analysis: >\n      Heatmap 可视化直观确认 NF2 和 NF3：训练时的 GAR 优化完全不迁移到推理，gate 的 2-7%\n      attenuation 在 attention pattern 层面不可见。在 worst tier 下，这个可视化在 Qwen 上\n      仍然有效，但需要追加 Llama 对比面板。如果 Llama 的 baseline attention 分布本身更分散\n      （goal attention 衰减更温和），这解释了为什么 gating 在 Llama 上可能有微弱正效果——\n      起点就不那么极端。\n\n  - name: \"Llama-3.1-8B Phase 1 GAR Degradation Diagnosis\"\n    plan_id: \"plan_009\"\n    description: >\n      在 Llama-3.1-8B base model 上运行与 Qwen 相同的 GAR 诊断流程（5 段对话，10 turns），\n      确认 GAR 衰减是否存在及其程度。\n    expected_results:\n      turn1_avg_gar: 0.0380\n      turn2_avg_gar: 0.0325\n      turn3_avg_gar: 0.0310\n      turn4_avg_gar: 0.0290\n      turn5_avg_gar: 0.0285\n      turn6_avg_gar: 0.0275\n      turn7_avg_gar: 0.0270\n      turn8_avg_gar: 0.0265\n      turn9_avg_gar: 0.0280\n      turn10_avg_gar: 0.0260\n      mid_turns_avg_gar: 0.0284\n      relative_drop: 0.25\n      pattern_type: \"non-monotonic, gentle slope with fluctuations\"\n    result_rationale: >\n      Worst tier 假设 Llama-3 base GAR 衰减很弱（raw drop 10-30%）或 pattern 不同。\n      预测 25% 的 relative drop（vs Qwen 70.8%）。原因：Llama-3.1-8B 使用标准 GQA（8 KV\n      heads vs Qwen 的 7 groups），RoPE 位置编码实现不同，pre-norm 与 Qwen 的 pre-norm\n      虽同为 RMSNorm 但 epsilon 和初始化不同。更重要的是，Llama 的 attention head 分布\n      可能天然更分散——Meta 的训练数据规模（15T tokens）远大于 Qwen（未公开但估计 3-7T），\n      使 attention pattern 更鲁棒，不容易出现极端的 goal attention 集中→衰减模式。\n      Non-monotonic pattern（turn 9 反弹）进一步暗示 Llama 的 attention 不是简单的单调衰减，\n      而是有更复杂的 turn-dependent 动态。这直接挑战 \"GAR 衰减是普遍的结构性现象\" 的 claim。\n    tables:\n      - name: \"Table: Cross-Model GAR Degradation Comparison\"\n        columns: [\"Model\", \"Turn 1 GAR\", \"Mid-Turn GAR\", \"Relative Drop\", \"Pattern\"]\n        rows:\n          - [\"Qwen-2.5-7B\", \"0.0418\", \"0.0122\", \"70.8%\", \"Monotonic decline\"]\n          - [\"Llama-3.1-8B\", \"0.0380\", \"0.0284\", \"25.3%\", \"Non-monotonic, gentle slope\"]\n    figures_description:\n      - \"Fig: Side-by-side per-turn GAR curves for Qwen (steep monotonic decline) and Llama (gentle fluctuating decline). Qwen drops sharply from turn 1-4 then plateaus near zero; Llama shows gradual decline with fluctuations, never reaching the extreme low values Qwen exhibits. Shaded regions show per-conversation variance.\"\n    analysis: >\n      25% drop 虽然仍是 \"degradation exists\"，但程度远弱于 Qwen 的 70.8%，且 non-monotonic\n      pattern 暗示不同的底层机制。这意味着 C1 的 claim 需要从 \"GAR 衰减是严重的结构性现象\"\n      修改为 \"GAR 衰减的严重程度是 architecture-dependent 的\"。Llama 的 higher baseline\n      mid-turn GAR (0.0284 vs 0.0122) 意味着 Llama 在没有任何干预的情况下就保留了更多的 goal\n      attention，这为后续 gating 可能在 Llama 上有正效果埋下伏笔。\n\n  - name: \"Llama-3.1-8B ThreadGate v7 Training\"\n    plan_id: \"plan_010\"\n    description: >\n      在 Llama-3.1-8B 上复制 Qwen v7 的 ThreadGate 训练设置（MSE+gate_div loss，3 epochs，\n      相同超参数），检测训练-推理 GAR gap。\n    expected_results:\n      training_gar_final: 0.42\n      inference_dongre_mid_gar: 0.0485\n      train_infer_gap_ratio: 8.7\n      inference_ours_mid_gar: 0.092\n      train_infer_ours_gap_ratio: 4.6\n      final_gate_mean: 0.9180\n      final_gate_std: 0.0380\n      final_gate_min: 0.8125\n      final_gate_max: 0.9805\n      gate_turn1_mean: 0.8650\n      gate_turn21_mean: 0.9350\n      gate_direction: \"same_as_qwen_but_weaker\"\n      gate_diff_turn1_turn21_layers_wrong_direction: 18\n      ppl: 2.95\n      ntp_loss: 0.982\n      training_time_hours: 7.2\n      epochs_completed: 3\n      gar_convergence_phase: \"A(gs0-100):plateau@0.03 B(gs100-200):rise C(gs200+):converged@0.42\"\n    result_rationale: >\n      Worst tier 假设 Llama 训练-推理 gap <5x（GAR-ours 口径）。Llama 的 training GAR\n      略低于 Qwen（0.42 vs 0.48），因为 Llama 的 attention head 结构不同，MSE loss 在\n      Llama 上收敛到略低的目标。但关键差异在推理端：Llama inference GAR-ours 达到 0.092\n      （vs Qwen 0.0157），gap 仅 4.6x（vs Qwen ~30x）。这说明 Llama 的 attention pattern\n      在 teacher-forcing→autoregressive 迁移中保留了更多训练信号。可能原因：(1) Llama 的\n      8 KV heads 比 Qwen 的 7 groups 提供了更多独立的 attention 通道，训练中学到的 GAR\n      pattern 可以分布在更多 heads 上，不容易被 NTP 完全覆盖；(2) Llama pre-training\n      的 attention 分布更分散，autoregressive context 对 attention 的扰动较小。\n      Gate profile 仍展现 wrong direction（turn 1 stronger attenuation than turn 21），\n      但差异更小（18/32 层 vs Qwen 27/28 层），说明 NTP-GAR 竞争在 Llama 上没那么极端。\n      GAR-Dongre 口径下 inference GAR 0.0485 也明显高于 Qwen 的 0.0152。\n    tables:\n      - name: \"Table: Training-Inference GAR Gap Comparison\"\n        columns: [\"Model\", \"Train GAR\", \"Infer GAR (ours)\", \"Gap Ratio (ours)\", \"Infer GAR (Dongre)\", \"Gap Ratio (Dongre)\"]\n        rows:\n          - [\"Qwen-2.5-7B\", \"0.48\", \"0.0157\", \"30.6x\", \"0.0152\", \"31.6x\"]\n          - [\"Llama-3.1-8B\", \"0.42\", \"0.092\", \"4.6x\", \"0.0485\", \"8.7x\"]\n    figures_description:\n      - \"Fig: Training GAR curve comparison. Both models show similar plateau→rise→converge dynamics, but Llama converges slower (gs 200 vs 144) and to a lower final value (0.42 vs 0.48).\"\n      - \"Fig: Gate profile comparison at inference. Llama gates show less extreme turn conditioning: turn 1 gate values ~0.865 (vs Qwen 0.77), turn 21 ~0.935 (vs Qwen 0.98). The wrong-direction pattern is present but attenuated.\"\n    analysis: >\n      4.6x gap (GAR-ours) vs Qwen 的 30x gap 是 worst tier 的核心打击。这直接否定了\n      \"30x distribution shift gap 是 universal\" 的 claim。但 8.7x gap (GAR-Dongre) 说明\n      在更严格的评估口径下 Llama 也存在显著的训练-推理不一致。叙事需 reframe：不是 \"30x gap\n      是普遍的\"，而是 \"distribution shift gap 存在但程度 architecture-dependent（Qwen 30x\n      vs Llama 4.6-8.7x），什么架构特性决定了这个差异？\" 这打开了新的分析维度但削弱了原始\n      contribution 的冲击力。\n\n  - name: \"Llama-3.1-8B LoRA-only Training\"\n    plan_id: \"plan_011\"\n    description: >\n      Llama-3.1-8B 上的 LoRA-only baseline 训练（无 gate，纯 NTP loss），用于与 TG\n      对比隔离 gating 贡献。\n    expected_results:\n      epochs_completed: 3\n      global_steps: 3000\n      training_time_hours: 7.0\n      final_ntp_loss: 0.978\n      ppl: 2.98\n      gate_fixed: 1\n      gate_type_actual: \"none\"\n      final_lora_size_mb: 22\n    result_rationale: >\n      LoRA-only training 在 Llama 上与 Qwen 上的行为类似——纯 NTP 优化，无 gate 参数。\n      PPL 和 NTP loss 与 TG 接近（2.98 vs 2.95），因为 gate 对 NTP 的影响很小。\n      Llama 的 base PPL 可能略高于 Qwen（因模型差异），但 fine-tuned PPL 差异不大。\n      这个 baseline 本身无 tier 差异，关键在于后续 eval 中 TG vs LoRA-only 的对比。\n    tables: []\n    figures_description: []\n    analysis: >\n      标准 baseline 训练，无意外。关键数据来自 plan_012 的三路 eval。\n\n  - name: \"Llama-3.1-8B 3-Way Eval (Base/TG/LoRA-only)\"\n    plan_id: \"plan_012\"\n    description: >\n      Llama-3.1-8B 上的三路评估（Base/TG/LoRA-only），使用 held-out 数据，\n      检验 gating 是否在 Llama 上也 zero-benefit。\n    expected_results:\n      base_dongre_mid_gar: 0.0035\n      base_ours_mid_gar: 0.0145\n      base_ppl: 4.55\n      tg_dongre_mid_gar: 0.0485\n      tg_ours_mid_gar: 0.092\n      tg_ppl: 2.95\n      lora_dongre_mid_gar: 0.0132\n      lora_ours_mid_gar: 0.058\n      lora_ppl: 2.98\n      tg_vs_lora_dongre_gar_diff_pp: 3.53\n      tg_vs_lora_ours_gar_diff_pp: 3.40\n      tg_vs_lora_ppl_diff: -0.03\n      gating_has_positive_effect: true\n    result_rationale: >\n      Worst tier 核心假设：Llama 上 gating 有 1-5pp 的微弱正效果。预测 TG vs LoRA-only\n      的 Dongre GAR 差异为 +3.53pp（0.0485 vs 0.0132），ours 口径差异 +3.40pp（0.092 vs\n      0.058）。这直接推翻 \"gating zero-benefit\" 的跨模型普遍性。原因：(1) Llama 的 attention\n      结构允许更多的 gate 信号传递到推理——8 个独立 KV heads 意味着 gate 可以选择性影响部分\n      heads 而不被 NTP 完全覆盖；(2) Llama 的 base GAR 衰减更温和（25% vs 70.8%），\n      attention pattern 离 \"完全丢失 goal attention\" 更远，gate 的微弱干预（2-7%）在这个\n      range 内可能产生可测量的效果；(3) Llama 的训练-推理 gap 更小（4.6x vs 30x），\n      训练中学到的 pattern 有更多迁移到推理。PPL 差异 -0.03（TG 略好）在噪声范围内，\n      但方向不是负面的（Qwen 上 TG 和 LoRA-only PPL 完全相同）。\n    tables:\n      - name: \"Table: Llama-3.1-8B 3-Way Evaluation\"\n        columns: [\"Model\", \"GAR-Dongre (mid)\", \"GAR-ours (mid)\", \"PPL\", \"NTP Loss\"]\n        rows:\n          - [\"Base\", \"0.0035\", \"0.0145\", \"4.55\", \"1.432\"]\n          - [\"ThreadGate\", \"0.0485\", \"0.092\", \"2.95\", \"0.982\"]\n          - [\"LoRA-only\", \"0.0132\", \"0.058\", \"2.98\", \"0.978\"]\n      - name: \"Table: Cross-Model Gating Benefit Comparison\"\n        columns: [\"Model\", \"TG-LoRA GAR diff (Dongre, pp)\", \"TG-LoRA GAR diff (ours, pp)\", \"TG-LoRA PPL diff\", \"Gating Benefit?\"]\n        rows:\n          - [\"Qwen-2.5-7B\", \"+0.20\", \"+0.57\", \"0.00\", \"None (zero)\"]\n          - [\"Llama-3.1-8B\", \"+3.53\", \"+3.40\", \"-0.03\", \"Weak positive\"]\n    figures_description:\n      - \"Fig: Bar chart comparing TG vs LoRA-only GAR (Dongre) across two models. Qwen bars nearly identical; Llama TG bar visibly taller (~3.5pp gap). Error bars from per-conversation variance overlap partially but centroids clearly separated.\"\n    analysis: >\n      这是 worst tier 的杀手级结果。Llama 上 TG 比 LoRA-only 高 3.53pp (Dongre) 意味着\n      gating mechanism 在 Llama 架构上确实有增量贡献。这不是巨大的效果（3.53pp on a base of\n      0.0132），但足以推翻 \"gating provides zero incremental contribution\" 的跨模型 claim。\n      C4 必须从 \"gating 无增量贡献\" 修改为 \"gating 的增量贡献是 architecture-dependent 的：\n      在 Qwen 上为零，在 Llama 上有微弱正效果\"。论文从 universal negative result 转为\n      contrastive architecture study。积极面：为什么 Llama 能部分受益而 Qwen 完全不能？\n      这个问题本身有分析价值。\n\n  - name: \"Llama-3.1-8B Gradient Conflict Analysis\"\n    plan_id: \"plan_013\"\n    description: >\n      在 Llama v7 训练 checkpoint 上提取 NTP-GAR 梯度冲突数据，与 Qwen 对比。\n    expected_results:\n      epoch0_cos_sim_mean: -0.015\n      epoch0_cos_sim_negative_layer_pct: 0.53\n      epoch0_mag_ratio_mean: 2.8\n      epoch2_cos_sim_mean: 0.008\n      epoch2_cos_sim_negative_layer_pct: 0.41\n      epoch2_mag_ratio_mean: 3.5\n      L31_mag_ratio_epoch2: 18.5\n      layers_with_persistent_negative_cos_sim: 6\n      cos_sim_positive_layer_pct_epoch2: 0.59\n    result_rationale: >\n      Worst tier 假设 Llama 梯度冲突不显著（cos_sim 接近 0 或正值为主）。预测 epoch 2 时\n      cos_sim 均值为 +0.008（从 epoch 0 的 -0.015 转正），59% 的层 cos_sim 为正。\n      这与 Qwen 的 67% negative 形成鲜明对比。原因：(1) Llama 的 GQA 8 heads 提供更多\n      参数自由度，NTP 和 GAR 可以在不同 head 子空间中分别优化，减少直接冲突；(2) Llama 的\n      RoPE 实现和 attention scaling 不同，使 gate 参数上的梯度分布更平滑；(3) Llama\n      pre-training 的 attention 初始化更均匀，NTP 不需要极端地 \"夺回\" gate 控制权。\n      Mag_ratio 最终仅 3.5x（vs Qwen 14.7x），最高层 18.5x（vs Qwen 1139x），说明\n      NTP 在 Llama 上对 GAR 的幅度压制远不如 Qwen 极端。\n    tables:\n      - name: \"Table: Cross-Model Gradient Conflict Comparison\"\n        columns: [\"Metric\", \"Qwen-2.5-7B\", \"Llama-3.1-8B\", \"Interpretation\"]\n        rows:\n          - [\"cos_sim (epoch 0)\", \"-0.089\", \"-0.015\", \"Qwen has 6x stronger initial directional conflict\"]\n          - [\"cos_sim (epoch 2)\", \"-0.042\", \"+0.008\", \"Llama resolves conflict; Qwen retains it\"]\n          - [\"% layers cos<0 (epoch 2)\", \"67%\", \"41%\", \"Majority of Llama layers are non-conflicting\"]\n          - [\"mag_ratio (epoch 2)\", \"14.7x\", \"3.5x\", \"NTP dominance 4x weaker on Llama\"]\n          - [\"Top layer mag_ratio\", \"1139x (L27)\", \"18.5x (L31)\", \"Extreme NTP suppression Qwen-specific\"]\n    figures_description:\n      - \"Fig: Side-by-side 2D heatmaps (layers x epochs) of cos_sim for Qwen and Llama. Qwen: persistent blue (negative) across most layers and epochs. Llama: transitions from light blue to light red (positive) in most layers by epoch 2. Stark visual contrast highlights architecture-dependent gradient dynamics.\"\n    analysis: >\n      这是 worst tier 下最具分析价值的对比数据。Llama 的梯度 \"和解\"（cos_sim 从 -0.015 转为\n      +0.008）vs Qwen 的持续冲突（-0.089 → -0.042 但从未转正）直接解释了为什么 gating 在\n      Llama 上有微弱正效果：NTP 和 GAR 在 Llama 上不是零和博弈。这支持了 architecture-dependent\n      vulnerability 的叙事——Qwen 的架构使 NTP-GAR 竞争成为不可调和的冲突，而 Llama 的架构\n      允许两者共存。核心 insight 从 \"gradient competition kills gating\" 转为 \"gradient\n      competition kills gating on architectures where NTP and GAR cannot find orthogonal subspaces\"。\n\n  - name: \"Downstream Task Sanity Check\"\n    plan_id: \"plan_014\"\n    description: >\n      简单的 system prompt instruction retention test：给定 system prompt 中的特定指令\n      （如 \"always respond in bullet points\"），测量 4 个 Qwen 模型在 10/20 turns 后\n      是否仍遵循该指令。\n    expected_results:\n      base_turn1_compliance: 0.85\n      base_turn10_compliance: 0.62\n      base_turn20_compliance: 0.48\n      tg_turn1_compliance: 0.87\n      tg_turn10_compliance: 0.63\n      tg_turn20_compliance: 0.50\n      lora_turn1_compliance: 0.86\n      lora_turn10_compliance: 0.64\n      lora_turn20_compliance: 0.49\n      ug_turn1_compliance: 0.86\n      ug_turn10_compliance: 0.63\n      ug_turn20_compliance: 0.49\n      gar_compliance_correlation: 0.35\n      tg_lora_compliance_diff_turn20: 0.01\n    result_rationale: >\n      Downstream compliance test 预计显示所有模型在长对话中 compliance 下降（从 ~85% 到\n      ~49%），与 GAR 衰减定性一致。但 TG vs LoRA-only 的差异极小（0.50 vs 0.49 at turn 20），\n      与 GAR 层面的 zero-benefit 一致。GAR-compliance 相关性仅 0.35（弱正相关），因为\n      compliance 受多种因素影响（不仅是 attention to system prompt，还有 instruction\n      understanding、generation capabilities 等），GAR 只是其中一个 proxy。在 worst tier 下，\n      这个弱相关性可能被 reviewer 质疑——如果 GAR 与下游任务只有弱相关，那 30x GAR gap\n      的实际意义被削弱。需要在论文中明确 acknowledge 这一限制。\n    tables:\n      - name: \"Table: Instruction Compliance Rate Across Turns\"\n        columns: [\"Model\", \"Turn 1\", \"Turn 5\", \"Turn 10\", \"Turn 15\", \"Turn 20\"]\n        rows:\n          - [\"Base\", \"0.85\", \"0.74\", \"0.62\", \"0.55\", \"0.48\"]\n          - [\"ThreadGate\", \"0.87\", \"0.76\", \"0.63\", \"0.56\", \"0.50\"]\n          - [\"LoRA-only\", \"0.86\", \"0.75\", \"0.64\", \"0.56\", \"0.49\"]\n          - [\"Uniform Gate\", \"0.86\", \"0.75\", \"0.63\", \"0.55\", \"0.49\"]\n    figures_description:\n      - \"Fig: Compliance rate vs turn number (4 models overlaid). All curves decline similarly. Scatter plot inset: GAR vs compliance across all turns and models, showing weak positive correlation (r=0.35) with large scatter.\"\n    analysis: >\n      弱相关性是 worst tier 下的一个风险因素。如果 reviewer 追问 \"GAR 衰减跟实际任务表现\n      到底有多大关系？\"，0.35 的相关不太有说服力。需要在 Discussion 中 frame 为：GAR 是\n      attention mechanism 层面的 proxy metric，不是 end-to-end 任务指标；compliance 下降\n      证明了 multi-turn degradation 是真实的，但具体机制可能比 attention-to-goal 更复杂。\n      积极面：所有模型的 compliance 差异极小，进一步支持 gating 无实际效果的结论（至少在 Qwen 上）。\n\n  - name: \"Bootstrap CI for TG-LoRA Comparison\"\n    plan_id: \"plan_015\"\n    description: >\n      使用 plan_008 的 held-out eval 数据（50 conversations），计算 TG vs LoRA-only\n      的 paired bootstrap 95% CI，统计检验 \"zero benefit\" 假设。\n    expected_results:\n      n_conversations: 50\n      n_bootstrap_samples: 10000\n      tg_lora_dongre_gar_diff_mean: 0.0020\n      tg_lora_dongre_gar_diff_ci_lower: -0.0025\n      tg_lora_dongre_gar_diff_ci_upper: 0.0068\n      tg_lora_ours_gar_diff_mean: 0.0057\n      tg_lora_ours_gar_diff_ci_lower: 0.0012\n      tg_lora_ours_gar_diff_ci_upper: 0.0105\n      tg_lora_ppl_diff_mean: 0.00\n      tg_lora_ppl_diff_ci_lower: -0.02\n      tg_lora_ppl_diff_ci_upper: 0.02\n      dongre_ci_includes_zero: true\n      ours_ci_includes_zero: false\n      ppl_ci_includes_zero: true\n    result_rationale: >\n      Worst tier 假设 \"一个或多个 bootstrap CI 不包含 0\"。预测 GAR-ours 口径的 CI 不包含 0\n      （lower bound 0.0012 > 0），而 GAR-Dongre 口径的 CI 包含 0（lower bound -0.0025）。\n      这种分裂发生的原因：GAR-ours 使用 \"system prompt + first user query\" 作为 goal tokens\n      且仅看 last token per assistant turn，这个定义下 TG 可能因训练时的 MSE target 优化\n      （即使推理时效果微弱）在 last-token position 上保留了一丝额外的 goal attention，\n      足以在统计上与 LoRA-only 分离。而 GAR-Dongre 的 \"all response tokens\" 平均化了这个\n      微弱信号，使 CI 仍包含 0。实际差异（0.57pp ours, 0.20pp Dongre）都极小，但统计上的\n      不一致给论文带来麻烦：reviewer 可以 argue \"在一种评估口径下 gating 有统计显著的正效果\"，\n      动摇 zero-benefit claim 的坚定性。\n    tables:\n      - name: \"Table: Paired Bootstrap 95% CI (TG minus LoRA-only, Qwen-2.5-7B)\"\n        columns: [\"Metric\", \"Mean Diff\", \"95% CI Lower\", \"95% CI Upper\", \"Includes 0?\", \"Interpretation\"]\n        rows:\n          - [\"GAR-Dongre (mid)\", \"+0.20pp\", \"-0.25pp\", \"+0.68pp\", \"Yes\", \"Zero benefit supported\"]\n          - [\"GAR-ours (mid)\", \"+0.57pp\", \"+0.12pp\", \"+1.05pp\", \"No\", \"Tiny but significant positive\"]\n          - [\"PPL\", \"0.00\", \"-0.02\", \"+0.02\", \"Yes\", \"No PPL impact\"]\n    figures_description:\n      - \"Fig: Forest plot showing three paired differences (GAR-Dongre, GAR-ours, PPL) with 95% bootstrap CIs. GAR-Dongre and PPL CIs straddle zero; GAR-ours CI sits entirely in positive territory (barely). Dashed vertical line at zero for reference.\"\n    analysis: >\n      GAR-ours CI 不包含 0 是 worst tier 的一个 complication。虽然效应极小（0.57pp），但\n      统计上 reviewer 可以挑战 \"zero benefit\" 的绝对 claim。应对策略：(1) 论文主表使用\n      GAR-Dongre（与 Dongre 可比），在该口径下 CI 包含 0 → \"zero benefit\" 成立；\n      (2) 在 appendix 报告 GAR-ours 结果，acknowledge 微弱正效果但 argue effect size\n      过小（<1pp）to be practically meaningful；(3) 将叙事从 \"statistically zero\" 微调为\n      \"practically negligible, with statistically significant but sub-1pp effect under one of\n      two evaluation definitions\"。在 worst tier 下这增加了写作难度但不致命。\n\n  - name: \"Exposure-Bias Mitigation (Scheduled Sampling)\"\n    plan_id: \"plan_016\"\n    description: >\n      使用 scheduled sampling 训练 ThreadGate v7：训练过程中逐步混入 model-generated\n      context（替代 teacher-forced gold context），测试能否缩小 30x training-inference\n      GAR gap。Linear schedule: epoch 0 = 100% teacher-forcing, epoch 2 = 50%\n      model-generated。\n    expected_results:\n      training_gar_final: 0.31\n      training_gar_teacher_forced_final: 0.44\n      training_gar_model_generated_final: 0.18\n      inference_dongre_mid_gar: 0.0165\n      inference_ours_mid_gar: 0.0175\n      baseline_inference_dongre_mid_gar: 0.0152\n      baseline_inference_ours_mid_gar: 0.0157\n      gap_reduction_factor: 0.92\n      gap_original_ours: 30.6\n      gap_mitigated_ours: 17.7\n      gap_reduction_pct: 42\n      actual_inference_gar_improvement_pp: 0.18\n      ppl: 2.72\n      ppl_vs_baseline: -0.06\n      training_time_hours: 9.5\n      scheduled_sampling_final_ratio: 0.5\n    result_rationale: >\n      Worst tier 假设 scheduled sampling 不缩小 gap（或缩小 <20%）。但实际预测更微妙：\n      gap ratio 从 30.6x 缩小到 17.7x（看似 42% reduction），但这主要是因为 training GAR\n      从 0.48 下降到 0.31（分母变小），而 inference GAR 几乎不变（0.0157→0.0175，仅 +0.18pp）。\n      真正的问题是：scheduled sampling 确实让模型在 model-generated context 上 \"看到\" 了\n      更真实的训练分布，但 NTP loss 仍主导梯度，在 model-generated context 上 NTP 的梯度\n      更大（因为 PPL 更高），进一步压制 GAR 信号。结果是：模型在 mixed context 上训练的\n      GAR 低于纯 teacher-forcing（0.31 vs 0.48），但推理端改善几乎为零。\n      mitigation_gap_reduction_factor = 实际推理 GAR 改善 / 理论预期改善 ≈ 0.92（接近 1\n      意味着 gap 实际上没缩小；此处按 inference GAR 绝对值计算 0.0175/0.0157 = 1.11，\n      即仅 11% 的 inference GAR 改善）。这说明 exposure bias 的 mitigation 不是简单地\n      \"让模型看到 model-generated context\" 就能解决——NTP-GAR 梯度竞争在任何 context\n      分布下都存在，这是一个 orthogonal 的问题。\n    tables:\n      - name: \"Table: Scheduled Sampling Mitigation Results (Qwen-2.5-7B)\"\n        columns: [\"Metric\", \"Baseline (TG v7)\", \"Scheduled Sampling\", \"Change\"]\n        rows:\n          - [\"Training GAR (final)\", \"0.48\", \"0.31\", \"-0.17 (↓35%)\"]\n          - [\"Inference GAR-ours\", \"0.0157\", \"0.0175\", \"+0.18pp (↑11%)\"]\n          - [\"Inference GAR-Dongre\", \"0.0152\", \"0.0165\", \"+0.13pp (↑9%)\"]\n          - [\"Train-Infer Gap (ours)\", \"30.6x\", \"17.7x\", \"↓42% (misleading)\"]\n          - [\"PPL\", \"2.63\", \"2.72\", \"+0.09 (↑3.4%)\"]\n          - [\"Training Time\", \"5.9h\", \"9.5h\", \"+61% overhead\"]\n    figures_description:\n      - \"Fig: Two-panel comparison. Left: Training GAR curves for baseline (reaches 0.48) and scheduled sampling (reaches 0.31, with model-generated portions showing much lower GAR ~0.18). Right: Inference GAR comparison — two nearly overlapping bar clusters, with scheduled sampling showing marginal +0.18pp improvement. The visual message: training changes dramatically but inference barely moves.\"\n      - \"Fig: Decomposed training GAR by context type. Teacher-forced portions maintain GAR ~0.44; model-generated portions stabilize at ~0.18. The gap between these two within-training curves foreshadows the failure to close the training-inference gap.\"\n    analysis: >\n      Scheduled sampling 的 \"失败\" 在 worst tier 下有两层含义：(1) 实证层面，推理 GAR 仅\n      改善 0.18pp（从 0.0157 到 0.0175），在实际意义上 negligible——这验证了 mitigation\n      无效的假设；(2) 理论层面，这提供了重要的因果排除证据：如果 exposure bias 是 30x gap\n      的主因，scheduled sampling 应该实质性缩小 gap，但它没有 → exposure bias 不是唯一\n      因素，甚至可能不是主因。NTP-GAR 梯度竞争是一个 independent failure mechanism，\n      在任何 context 分布下都存在。这在 worst tier 叙事中变为 \"exposure bias 不是唯一因素\"\n      的证据，引入 architecture-specific confound。但这也削弱了 SP1 的核心卖点——如果\n      exposure bias 不是主因，那 \"exposure bias 的首个定量测量\" 的叙事价值下降。需要 reframe\n      SP1 为 \"distribution shift 和 gradient competition 的 entangled effects 的首个量化\"。\n```"}],"stop_reason":null,"stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":2,"cache_creation_input_tokens":20039,"cache_read_input_tokens":11841,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":20039},"output_tokens":27,"service_tier":"standard","inference_geo":"not_available"},"diagnostics":null,"context_management":null},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"5f656fc9-3579-461d-a490-ffcd13e5ba84","uuid":"83ce55f0-1e4f-4278-84e8-5f1526db5bc2"}
{"type":"result","subtype":"success","is_error":false,"api_error_status":null,"duration_ms":258767,"duration_api_ms":260262,"num_turns":1,"result":"```yaml\ntier: worst\nnarrative_guidance: >\n  Reframe 为 'Why does gating fail on Qwen but not Llama? An architecture-dependent analysis of\n  NTP-auxiliary loss interaction'。核心 angle 转向两个架构的对比本身成为 insight——什么架构特性使\n  Qwen 更脆弱（GQA head 结构差异、layer norm 位置、attention pattern 分布）。SP1 从 '普遍现象的\n  首个量化' 收窄为 'architecture-dependent vulnerability 的首个量化 + 对比分析'。30x gap 仍是\n  Qwen 上的有效 finding，但不再 claim 普遍性。Mitigation 负面结果变为 'exposure bias 不是唯一因素'\n  的证据，引入 architecture-specific confound。仍投 EMNLP Findings（不降级 venue），但叙事从\n  universal mechanism 转为 contrastive case study。需追加 Llama 的详细 gate profile + attention\n  pattern 对比分析，写作量增加。预期 review score 2.5-3.0。\n\nimagined_experiments:\n  - name: \"Qwen v7 Gradient Conflict Analysis (3 checkpoints)\"\n    plan_id: \"plan_006\"\n    description: >\n      对 v7 训练的 3 个 epoch checkpoint 提取 NTP 与 GAR loss 在 gate 参数上的梯度，\n      计算逐层 cosine similarity 和 magnitude ratio。Qwen 数据本身不受 worst tier 影响\n      （已在 Qwen 上观测到强梯度冲突），但在 worst tier 叙事下，这些数据将被 reframe 为\n      Qwen-specific vulnerability 而非 universal mechanism。\n    expected_results:\n      epoch0_cos_sim_mean: -0.089\n      epoch0_cos_sim_negative_layer_pct: 0.79\n      epoch0_mag_ratio_mean: 7.5\n      epoch1_cos_sim_mean: -0.061\n      epoch1_cos_sim_negative_layer_pct: 0.71\n      epoch1_mag_ratio_mean: 11.2\n      epoch2_cos_sim_mean: -0.042\n      epoch2_cos_sim_negative_layer_pct: 0.67\n      epoch2_mag_ratio_mean: 14.7\n      L27_mag_ratio_epoch0: 135\n      L27_mag_ratio_epoch2: 1139\n      layers_with_persistent_negative_cos_sim: 18\n    result_rationale: >\n      Qwen-2.5-7B 的梯度冲突数据已在 D014/D015 中间接观测并在 paper_framing 中引用。\n      此实验是正式化提取。Qwen 的 GQA 结构（28 层，grouped query attention with fewer KV heads）\n      使得 NTP 梯度在 gate 参数上的投影与 GAR 梯度方向持续冲突。cos_sim 从 -0.089 缓解到\n      -0.042 不是因为两个 loss 调和，而是 GAR 信号被边缘化（mag_ratio 从 7.5x 涨到 14.7x）。\n      L27 的 mag_ratio 从 135x 暴涨到 1139x 说明最后几层 NTP 完全主导 gate 学习。这些数字\n      在 worst tier 下不变，但叙事角色从 \"universal gradient competition\" 降级为\n      \"Qwen-specific gradient competition\"，与 Llama 的弱冲突形成对比。\n    tables:\n      - name: \"Table: NTP-GAR Gradient Conflict Across Training (Qwen-2.5-7B)\"\n        columns: [\"Checkpoint\", \"cos_sim (mean±std)\", \"% layers cos<0\", \"mag_ratio (mean)\", \"mag_ratio (L27)\", \"Interpretation\"]\n        rows:\n          - [\"Epoch 0 (gs 2650)\", \"-0.089 ± 0.12\", \"79%\", \"7.5x\", \"135x\", \"Strong directional conflict, moderate NTP dominance\"]\n          - [\"Epoch 1 (gs 5300)\", \"-0.061 ± 0.11\", \"71%\", \"11.2x\", \"487x\", \"Conflict weakening as GAR signal marginalized\"]\n          - [\"Epoch 2 (gs 7950)\", \"-0.042 ± 0.10\", \"67%\", \"14.7x\", \"1139x\", \"GAR effectively silenced; NTP fully controls gates\"]\n    figures_description:\n      - \"Fig: 28-layer heatmap of cos_sim across 3 checkpoints. Color: blue=negative (conflict), red=positive (aligned). Shows persistent blue in layers 3-14 (early-mid), with layers 25-27 deep blue across all checkpoints. Upper layers transition from blue to near-zero, indicating GAR gradient vanishing rather than alignment.\"\n      - \"Fig: Per-layer mag_ratio bar chart at epoch 2. Logarithmic y-axis. Layers 25-27 show extreme ratios (100-1139x), layers 0-5 moderate (5-15x). Demonstrates NTP dominance is strongest in final layers where attention routing decisions matter most.\"\n    analysis: >\n      Qwen 的梯度冲突证据仍然是 valid finding。在 worst tier 下，关键 reframing 是：为什么\n      Llama 不展现同样程度的冲突？假说：Qwen 的 GQA 结构中 KV heads 较少（7 groups vs Llama\n      的 8 groups），attention 参数共享程度更高，使得 NTP 和 GAR 在相同参数空间上的竞争更激烈。\n      这个对比本身成为新的 insight，但也意味着 claim 必须从 \"NTP-GAR competition is a fundamental\n      obstacle\" 收窄为 \"NTP-GAR competition severity is architecture-dependent\"。\n\n  - name: \"Attention Heatmap Visualization (4 models x 3 convs x 28 layers)\"\n    plan_id: \"plan_007\"\n    description: >\n      对 4 个模型（Base/TG/UG/LoRA-only）在 3 段 held-out 对话上提取 28 层的 attention\n      pattern，可视化 goal token attention 随 turn 的变化。\n    expected_results:\n      base_turn1_goal_attn_mean: 0.042\n      base_turn10_goal_attn_mean: 0.008\n      tg_turn1_goal_attn_mean: 0.039\n      tg_turn10_goal_attn_mean: 0.009\n      ug_turn1_goal_attn_mean: 0.041\n      ug_turn10_goal_attn_mean: 0.008\n      lora_turn1_goal_attn_mean: 0.040\n      lora_turn10_goal_attn_mean: 0.009\n      cross_model_attn_pattern_correlation: 0.97\n      layers_with_visible_gate_effect: 0\n    result_rationale: >\n      推理时 gate 值均在 0.93-0.98 范围（NF3: 2-7% attenuation），对 attention pattern 的\n      实际影响微乎其微。因此 4 个模型的 attention heatmap 在视觉上几乎不可区分——均展现相同的\n      goal attention 衰减模式。TG 和 UG 的 gate 在推理时接近 identity，无法将训练时学到的\n      attention pattern 迁移到自回归生成上下文。LoRA fine-tuning 改变的是 NTP 相关的 attention\n      分布，不影响 goal-specific attention。Base 模型有更高 PPL（4.23 vs 2.63），但 goal\n      attention 衰减模式相同。在 worst tier 下，这些 Qwen 可视化仍有效，但需要与 Llama 的\n      heatmap 形成对比——Llama 可能展现不同的 baseline attention 分布模式。\n    tables:\n      - name: \"Table: Goal Token Attention by Model and Turn (Qwen-2.5-7B, averaged across layers and conversations)\"\n        columns: [\"Model\", \"Turn 1\", \"Turn 5\", \"Turn 10\", \"Turn 15\", \"Turn 20\", \"Relative Drop (T1→T20)\"]\n        rows:\n          - [\"Base\", \"0.042\", \"0.018\", \"0.008\", \"0.006\", \"0.005\", \"88.1%\"]\n          - [\"ThreadGate\", \"0.039\", \"0.017\", \"0.009\", \"0.007\", \"0.005\", \"87.2%\"]\n          - [\"Uniform Gate\", \"0.041\", \"0.018\", \"0.008\", \"0.006\", \"0.005\", \"87.8%\"]\n          - [\"LoRA-only\", \"0.040\", \"0.017\", \"0.009\", \"0.006\", \"0.005\", \"87.5%\"]\n    figures_description:\n      - \"Fig: 4x1 panel of attention heatmaps (rows=28 layers, cols=20 turns) for each model. Color intensity = goal token attention weight. All four panels visually identical: bright column at turn 1 fading to near-black by turn 10+. No discernible gate effect in TG/UG panels.\"\n      - \"Fig: Layer-aggregated goal attention curves (4 models overlaid) for one representative conversation. Lines overlap almost perfectly (cross-model correlation 0.97), confirming gating has zero impact on inference-time attention patterns.\"\n    analysis: >\n      Heatmap 可视化直观确认 NF2 和 NF3：训练时的 GAR 优化完全不迁移到推理，gate 的 2-7%\n      attenuation 在 attention pattern 层面不可见。在 worst tier 下，这个可视化在 Qwen 上\n      仍然有效，但需要追加 Llama 对比面板。如果 Llama 的 baseline attention 分布本身更分散\n      （goal attention 衰减更温和），这解释了为什么 gating 在 Llama 上可能有微弱正效果——\n      起点就不那么极端。\n\n  - name: \"Llama-3.1-8B Phase 1 GAR Degradation Diagnosis\"\n    plan_id: \"plan_009\"\n    description: >\n      在 Llama-3.1-8B base model 上运行与 Qwen 相同的 GAR 诊断流程（5 段对话，10 turns），\n      确认 GAR 衰减是否存在及其程度。\n    expected_results:\n      turn1_avg_gar: 0.0380\n      turn2_avg_gar: 0.0325\n      turn3_avg_gar: 0.0310\n      turn4_avg_gar: 0.0290\n      turn5_avg_gar: 0.0285\n      turn6_avg_gar: 0.0275\n      turn7_avg_gar: 0.0270\n      turn8_avg_gar: 0.0265\n      turn9_avg_gar: 0.0280\n      turn10_avg_gar: 0.0260\n      mid_turns_avg_gar: 0.0284\n      relative_drop: 0.25\n      pattern_type: \"non-monotonic, gentle slope with fluctuations\"\n    result_rationale: >\n      Worst tier 假设 Llama-3 base GAR 衰减很弱（raw drop 10-30%）或 pattern 不同。\n      预测 25% 的 relative drop（vs Qwen 70.8%）。原因：Llama-3.1-8B 使用标准 GQA（8 KV\n      heads vs Qwen 的 7 groups），RoPE 位置编码实现不同，pre-norm 与 Qwen 的 pre-norm\n      虽同为 RMSNorm 但 epsilon 和初始化不同。更重要的是，Llama 的 attention head 分布\n      可能天然更分散——Meta 的训练数据规模（15T tokens）远大于 Qwen（未公开但估计 3-7T），\n      使 attention pattern 更鲁棒，不容易出现极端的 goal attention 集中→衰减模式。\n      Non-monotonic pattern（turn 9 反弹）进一步暗示 Llama 的 attention 不是简单的单调衰减，\n      而是有更复杂的 turn-dependent 动态。这直接挑战 \"GAR 衰减是普遍的结构性现象\" 的 claim。\n    tables:\n      - name: \"Table: Cross-Model GAR Degradation Comparison\"\n        columns: [\"Model\", \"Turn 1 GAR\", \"Mid-Turn GAR\", \"Relative Drop\", \"Pattern\"]\n        rows:\n          - [\"Qwen-2.5-7B\", \"0.0418\", \"0.0122\", \"70.8%\", \"Monotonic decline\"]\n          - [\"Llama-3.1-8B\", \"0.0380\", \"0.0284\", \"25.3%\", \"Non-monotonic, gentle slope\"]\n    figures_description:\n      - \"Fig: Side-by-side per-turn GAR curves for Qwen (steep monotonic decline) and Llama (gentle fluctuating decline). Qwen drops sharply from turn 1-4 then plateaus near zero; Llama shows gradual decline with fluctuations, never reaching the extreme low values Qwen exhibits. Shaded regions show per-conversation variance.\"\n    analysis: >\n      25% drop 虽然仍是 \"degradation exists\"，但程度远弱于 Qwen 的 70.8%，且 non-monotonic\n      pattern 暗示不同的底层机制。这意味着 C1 的 claim 需要从 \"GAR 衰减是严重的结构性现象\"\n      修改为 \"GAR 衰减的严重程度是 architecture-dependent 的\"。Llama 的 higher baseline\n      mid-turn GAR (0.0284 vs 0.0122) 意味着 Llama 在没有任何干预的情况下就保留了更多的 goal\n      attention，这为后续 gating 可能在 Llama 上有正效果埋下伏笔。\n\n  - name: \"Llama-3.1-8B ThreadGate v7 Training\"\n    plan_id: \"plan_010\"\n    description: >\n      在 Llama-3.1-8B 上复制 Qwen v7 的 ThreadGate 训练设置（MSE+gate_div loss，3 epochs，\n      相同超参数），检测训练-推理 GAR gap。\n    expected_results:\n      training_gar_final: 0.42\n      inference_dongre_mid_gar: 0.0485\n      train_infer_gap_ratio: 8.7\n      inference_ours_mid_gar: 0.092\n      train_infer_ours_gap_ratio: 4.6\n      final_gate_mean: 0.9180\n      final_gate_std: 0.0380\n      final_gate_min: 0.8125\n      final_gate_max: 0.9805\n      gate_turn1_mean: 0.8650\n      gate_turn21_mean: 0.9350\n      gate_direction: \"same_as_qwen_but_weaker\"\n      gate_diff_turn1_turn21_layers_wrong_direction: 18\n      ppl: 2.95\n      ntp_loss: 0.982\n      training_time_hours: 7.2\n      epochs_completed: 3\n      gar_convergence_phase: \"A(gs0-100):plateau@0.03 B(gs100-200):rise C(gs200+):converged@0.42\"\n    result_rationale: >\n      Worst tier 假设 Llama 训练-推理 gap <5x（GAR-ours 口径）。Llama 的 training GAR\n      略低于 Qwen（0.42 vs 0.48），因为 Llama 的 attention head 结构不同，MSE loss 在\n      Llama 上收敛到略低的目标。但关键差异在推理端：Llama inference GAR-ours 达到 0.092\n      （vs Qwen 0.0157），gap 仅 4.6x（vs Qwen ~30x）。这说明 Llama 的 attention pattern\n      在 teacher-forcing→autoregressive 迁移中保留了更多训练信号。可能原因：(1) Llama 的\n      8 KV heads 比 Qwen 的 7 groups 提供了更多独立的 attention 通道，训练中学到的 GAR\n      pattern 可以分布在更多 heads 上，不容易被 NTP 完全覆盖；(2) Llama pre-training\n      的 attention 分布更分散，autoregressive context 对 attention 的扰动较小。\n      Gate profile 仍展现 wrong direction（turn 1 stronger attenuation than turn 21），\n      但差异更小（18/32 层 vs Qwen 27/28 层），说明 NTP-GAR 竞争在 Llama 上没那么极端。\n      GAR-Dongre 口径下 inference GAR 0.0485 也明显高于 Qwen 的 0.0152。\n    tables:\n      - name: \"Table: Training-Inference GAR Gap Comparison\"\n        columns: [\"Model\", \"Train GAR\", \"Infer GAR (ours)\", \"Gap Ratio (ours)\", \"Infer GAR (Dongre)\", \"Gap Ratio (Dongre)\"]\n        rows:\n          - [\"Qwen-2.5-7B\", \"0.48\", \"0.0157\", \"30.6x\", \"0.0152\", \"31.6x\"]\n          - [\"Llama-3.1-8B\", \"0.42\", \"0.092\", \"4.6x\", \"0.0485\", \"8.7x\"]\n    figures_description:\n      - \"Fig: Training GAR curve comparison. Both models show similar plateau→rise→converge dynamics, but Llama converges slower (gs 200 vs 144) and to a lower final value (0.42 vs 0.48).\"\n      - \"Fig: Gate profile comparison at inference. Llama gates show less extreme turn conditioning: turn 1 gate values ~0.865 (vs Qwen 0.77), turn 21 ~0.935 (vs Qwen 0.98). The wrong-direction pattern is present but attenuated.\"\n    analysis: >\n      4.6x gap (GAR-ours) vs Qwen 的 30x gap 是 worst tier 的核心打击。这直接否定了\n      \"30x distribution shift gap 是 universal\" 的 claim。但 8.7x gap (GAR-Dongre) 说明\n      在更严格的评估口径下 Llama 也存在显著的训练-推理不一致。叙事需 reframe：不是 \"30x gap\n      是普遍的\"，而是 \"distribution shift gap 存在但程度 architecture-dependent（Qwen 30x\n      vs Llama 4.6-8.7x），什么架构特性决定了这个差异？\" 这打开了新的分析维度但削弱了原始\n      contribution 的冲击力。\n\n  - name: \"Llama-3.1-8B LoRA-only Training\"\n    plan_id: \"plan_011\"\n    description: >\n      Llama-3.1-8B 上的 LoRA-only baseline 训练（无 gate，纯 NTP loss），用于与 TG\n      对比隔离 gating 贡献。\n    expected_results:\n      epochs_completed: 3\n      global_steps: 3000\n      training_time_hours: 7.0\n      final_ntp_loss: 0.978\n      ppl: 2.98\n      gate_fixed: 1\n      gate_type_actual: \"none\"\n      final_lora_size_mb: 22\n    result_rationale: >\n      LoRA-only training 在 Llama 上与 Qwen 上的行为类似——纯 NTP 优化，无 gate 参数。\n      PPL 和 NTP loss 与 TG 接近（2.98 vs 2.95），因为 gate 对 NTP 的影响很小。\n      Llama 的 base PPL 可能略高于 Qwen（因模型差异），但 fine-tuned PPL 差异不大。\n      这个 baseline 本身无 tier 差异，关键在于后续 eval 中 TG vs LoRA-only 的对比。\n    tables: []\n    figures_description: []\n    analysis: >\n      标准 baseline 训练，无意外。关键数据来自 plan_012 的三路 eval。\n\n  - name: \"Llama-3.1-8B 3-Way Eval (Base/TG/LoRA-only)\"\n    plan_id: \"plan_012\"\n    description: >\n      Llama-3.1-8B 上的三路评估（Base/TG/LoRA-only），使用 held-out 数据，\n      检验 gating 是否在 Llama 上也 zero-benefit。\n    expected_results:\n      base_dongre_mid_gar: 0.0035\n      base_ours_mid_gar: 0.0145\n      base_ppl: 4.55\n      tg_dongre_mid_gar: 0.0485\n      tg_ours_mid_gar: 0.092\n      tg_ppl: 2.95\n      lora_dongre_mid_gar: 0.0132\n      lora_ours_mid_gar: 0.058\n      lora_ppl: 2.98\n      tg_vs_lora_dongre_gar_diff_pp: 3.53\n      tg_vs_lora_ours_gar_diff_pp: 3.40\n      tg_vs_lora_ppl_diff: -0.03\n      gating_has_positive_effect: true\n    result_rationale: >\n      Worst tier 核心假设：Llama 上 gating 有 1-5pp 的微弱正效果。预测 TG vs LoRA-only\n      的 Dongre GAR 差异为 +3.53pp（0.0485 vs 0.0132），ours 口径差异 +3.40pp（0.092 vs\n      0.058）。这直接推翻 \"gating zero-benefit\" 的跨模型普遍性。原因：(1) Llama 的 attention\n      结构允许更多的 gate 信号传递到推理——8 个独立 KV heads 意味着 gate 可以选择性影响部分\n      heads 而不被 NTP 完全覆盖；(2) Llama 的 base GAR 衰减更温和（25% vs 70.8%），\n      attention pattern 离 \"完全丢失 goal attention\" 更远，gate 的微弱干预（2-7%）在这个\n      range 内可能产生可测量的效果；(3) Llama 的训练-推理 gap 更小（4.6x vs 30x），\n      训练中学到的 pattern 有更多迁移到推理。PPL 差异 -0.03（TG 略好）在噪声范围内，\n      但方向不是负面的（Qwen 上 TG 和 LoRA-only PPL 完全相同）。\n    tables:\n      - name: \"Table: Llama-3.1-8B 3-Way Evaluation\"\n        columns: [\"Model\", \"GAR-Dongre (mid)\", \"GAR-ours (mid)\", \"PPL\", \"NTP Loss\"]\n        rows:\n          - [\"Base\", \"0.0035\", \"0.0145\", \"4.55\", \"1.432\"]\n          - [\"ThreadGate\", \"0.0485\", \"0.092\", \"2.95\", \"0.982\"]\n          - [\"LoRA-only\", \"0.0132\", \"0.058\", \"2.98\", \"0.978\"]\n      - name: \"Table: Cross-Model Gating Benefit Comparison\"\n        columns: [\"Model\", \"TG-LoRA GAR diff (Dongre, pp)\", \"TG-LoRA GAR diff (ours, pp)\", \"TG-LoRA PPL diff\", \"Gating Benefit?\"]\n        rows:\n          - [\"Qwen-2.5-7B\", \"+0.20\", \"+0.57\", \"0.00\", \"None (zero)\"]\n          - [\"Llama-3.1-8B\", \"+3.53\", \"+3.40\", \"-0.03\", \"Weak positive\"]\n    figures_description:\n      - \"Fig: Bar chart comparing TG vs LoRA-only GAR (Dongre) across two models. Qwen bars nearly identical; Llama TG bar visibly taller (~3.5pp gap). Error bars from per-conversation variance overlap partially but centroids clearly separated.\"\n    analysis: >\n      这是 worst tier 的杀手级结果。Llama 上 TG 比 LoRA-only 高 3.53pp (Dongre) 意味着\n      gating mechanism 在 Llama 架构上确实有增量贡献。这不是巨大的效果（3.53pp on a base of\n      0.0132），但足以推翻 \"gating provides zero incremental contribution\" 的跨模型 claim。\n      C4 必须从 \"gating 无增量贡献\" 修改为 \"gating 的增量贡献是 architecture-dependent 的：\n      在 Qwen 上为零，在 Llama 上有微弱正效果\"。论文从 universal negative result 转为\n      contrastive architecture study。积极面：为什么 Llama 能部分受益而 Qwen 完全不能？\n      这个问题本身有分析价值。\n\n  - name: \"Llama-3.1-8B Gradient Conflict Analysis\"\n    plan_id: \"plan_013\"\n    description: >\n      在 Llama v7 训练 checkpoint 上提取 NTP-GAR 梯度冲突数据，与 Qwen 对比。\n    expected_results:\n      epoch0_cos_sim_mean: -0.015\n      epoch0_cos_sim_negative_layer_pct: 0.53\n      epoch0_mag_ratio_mean: 2.8\n      epoch2_cos_sim_mean: 0.008\n      epoch2_cos_sim_negative_layer_pct: 0.41\n      epoch2_mag_ratio_mean: 3.5\n      L31_mag_ratio_epoch2: 18.5\n      layers_with_persistent_negative_cos_sim: 6\n      cos_sim_positive_layer_pct_epoch2: 0.59\n    result_rationale: >\n      Worst tier 假设 Llama 梯度冲突不显著（cos_sim 接近 0 或正值为主）。预测 epoch 2 时\n      cos_sim 均值为 +0.008（从 epoch 0 的 -0.015 转正），59% 的层 cos_sim 为正。\n      这与 Qwen 的 67% negative 形成鲜明对比。原因：(1) Llama 的 GQA 8 heads 提供更多\n      参数自由度，NTP 和 GAR 可以在不同 head 子空间中分别优化，减少直接冲突；(2) Llama 的\n      RoPE 实现和 attention scaling 不同，使 gate 参数上的梯度分布更平滑；(3) Llama\n      pre-training 的 attention 初始化更均匀，NTP 不需要极端地 \"夺回\" gate 控制权。\n      Mag_ratio 最终仅 3.5x（vs Qwen 14.7x），最高层 18.5x（vs Qwen 1139x），说明\n      NTP 在 Llama 上对 GAR 的幅度压制远不如 Qwen 极端。\n    tables:\n      - name: \"Table: Cross-Model Gradient Conflict Comparison\"\n        columns: [\"Metric\", \"Qwen-2.5-7B\", \"Llama-3.1-8B\", \"Interpretation\"]\n        rows:\n          - [\"cos_sim (epoch 0)\", \"-0.089\", \"-0.015\", \"Qwen has 6x stronger initial directional conflict\"]\n          - [\"cos_sim (epoch 2)\", \"-0.042\", \"+0.008\", \"Llama resolves conflict; Qwen retains it\"]\n          - [\"% layers cos<0 (epoch 2)\", \"67%\", \"41%\", \"Majority of Llama layers are non-conflicting\"]\n          - [\"mag_ratio (epoch 2)\", \"14.7x\", \"3.5x\", \"NTP dominance 4x weaker on Llama\"]\n          - [\"Top layer mag_ratio\", \"1139x (L27)\", \"18.5x (L31)\", \"Extreme NTP suppression Qwen-specific\"]\n    figures_description:\n      - \"Fig: Side-by-side 2D heatmaps (layers x epochs) of cos_sim for Qwen and Llama. Qwen: persistent blue (negative) across most layers and epochs. Llama: transitions from light blue to light red (positive) in most layers by epoch 2. Stark visual contrast highlights architecture-dependent gradient dynamics.\"\n    analysis: >\n      这是 worst tier 下最具分析价值的对比数据。Llama 的梯度 \"和解\"（cos_sim 从 -0.015 转为\n      +0.008）vs Qwen 的持续冲突（-0.089 → -0.042 但从未转正）直接解释了为什么 gating 在\n      Llama 上有微弱正效果：NTP 和 GAR 在 Llama 上不是零和博弈。这支持了 architecture-dependent\n      vulnerability 的叙事——Qwen 的架构使 NTP-GAR 竞争成为不可调和的冲突，而 Llama 的架构\n      允许两者共存。核心 insight 从 \"gradient competition kills gating\" 转为 \"gradient\n      competition kills gating on architectures where NTP and GAR cannot find orthogonal subspaces\"。\n\n  - name: \"Downstream Task Sanity Check\"\n    plan_id: \"plan_014\"\n    description: >\n      简单的 system prompt instruction retention test：给定 system prompt 中的特定指令\n      （如 \"always respond in bullet points\"），测量 4 个 Qwen 模型在 10/20 turns 后\n      是否仍遵循该指令。\n    expected_results:\n      base_turn1_compliance: 0.85\n      base_turn10_compliance: 0.62\n      base_turn20_compliance: 0.48\n      tg_turn1_compliance: 0.87\n      tg_turn10_compliance: 0.63\n      tg_turn20_compliance: 0.50\n      lora_turn1_compliance: 0.86\n      lora_turn10_compliance: 0.64\n      lora_turn20_compliance: 0.49\n      ug_turn1_compliance: 0.86\n      ug_turn10_compliance: 0.63\n      ug_turn20_compliance: 0.49\n      gar_compliance_correlation: 0.35\n      tg_lora_compliance_diff_turn20: 0.01\n    result_rationale: >\n      Downstream compliance test 预计显示所有模型在长对话中 compliance 下降（从 ~85% 到\n      ~49%），与 GAR 衰减定性一致。但 TG vs LoRA-only 的差异极小（0.50 vs 0.49 at turn 20），\n      与 GAR 层面的 zero-benefit 一致。GAR-compliance 相关性仅 0.35（弱正相关），因为\n      compliance 受多种因素影响（不仅是 attention to system prompt，还有 instruction\n      understanding、generation capabilities 等），GAR 只是其中一个 proxy。在 worst tier 下，\n      这个弱相关性可能被 reviewer 质疑——如果 GAR 与下游任务只有弱相关，那 30x GAR gap\n      的实际意义被削弱。需要在论文中明确 acknowledge 这一限制。\n    tables:\n      - name: \"Table: Instruction Compliance Rate Across Turns\"\n        columns: [\"Model\", \"Turn 1\", \"Turn 5\", \"Turn 10\", \"Turn 15\", \"Turn 20\"]\n        rows:\n          - [\"Base\", \"0.85\", \"0.74\", \"0.62\", \"0.55\", \"0.48\"]\n          - [\"ThreadGate\", \"0.87\", \"0.76\", \"0.63\", \"0.56\", \"0.50\"]\n          - [\"LoRA-only\", \"0.86\", \"0.75\", \"0.64\", \"0.56\", \"0.49\"]\n          - [\"Uniform Gate\", \"0.86\", \"0.75\", \"0.63\", \"0.55\", \"0.49\"]\n    figures_description:\n      - \"Fig: Compliance rate vs turn number (4 models overlaid). All curves decline similarly. Scatter plot inset: GAR vs compliance across all turns and models, showing weak positive correlation (r=0.35) with large scatter.\"\n    analysis: >\n      弱相关性是 worst tier 下的一个风险因素。如果 reviewer 追问 \"GAR 衰减跟实际任务表现\n      到底有多大关系？\"，0.35 的相关不太有说服力。需要在 Discussion 中 frame 为：GAR 是\n      attention mechanism 层面的 proxy metric，不是 end-to-end 任务指标；compliance 下降\n      证明了 multi-turn degradation 是真实的，但具体机制可能比 attention-to-goal 更复杂。\n      积极面：所有模型的 compliance 差异极小，进一步支持 gating 无实际效果的结论（至少在 Qwen 上）。\n\n  - name: \"Bootstrap CI for TG-LoRA Comparison\"\n    plan_id: \"plan_015\"\n    description: >\n      使用 plan_008 的 held-out eval 数据（50 conversations），计算 TG vs LoRA-only\n      的 paired bootstrap 95% CI，统计检验 \"zero benefit\" 假设。\n    expected_results:\n      n_conversations: 50\n      n_bootstrap_samples: 10000\n      tg_lora_dongre_gar_diff_mean: 0.0020\n      tg_lora_dongre_gar_diff_ci_lower: -0.0025\n      tg_lora_dongre_gar_diff_ci_upper: 0.0068\n      tg_lora_ours_gar_diff_mean: 0.0057\n      tg_lora_ours_gar_diff_ci_lower: 0.0012\n      tg_lora_ours_gar_diff_ci_upper: 0.0105\n      tg_lora_ppl_diff_mean: 0.00\n      tg_lora_ppl_diff_ci_lower: -0.02\n      tg_lora_ppl_diff_ci_upper: 0.02\n      dongre_ci_includes_zero: true\n      ours_ci_includes_zero: false\n      ppl_ci_includes_zero: true\n    result_rationale: >\n      Worst tier 假设 \"一个或多个 bootstrap CI 不包含 0\"。预测 GAR-ours 口径的 CI 不包含 0\n      （lower bound 0.0012 > 0），而 GAR-Dongre 口径的 CI 包含 0（lower bound -0.0025）。\n      这种分裂发生的原因：GAR-ours 使用 \"system prompt + first user query\" 作为 goal tokens\n      且仅看 last token per assistant turn，这个定义下 TG 可能因训练时的 MSE target 优化\n      （即使推理时效果微弱）在 last-token position 上保留了一丝额外的 goal attention，\n      足以在统计上与 LoRA-only 分离。而 GAR-Dongre 的 \"all response tokens\" 平均化了这个\n      微弱信号，使 CI 仍包含 0。实际差异（0.57pp ours, 0.20pp Dongre）都极小，但统计上的\n      不一致给论文带来麻烦：reviewer 可以 argue \"在一种评估口径下 gating 有统计显著的正效果\"，\n      动摇 zero-benefit claim 的坚定性。\n    tables:\n      - name: \"Table: Paired Bootstrap 95% CI (TG minus LoRA-only, Qwen-2.5-7B)\"\n        columns: [\"Metric\", \"Mean Diff\", \"95% CI Lower\", \"95% CI Upper\", \"Includes 0?\", \"Interpretation\"]\n        rows:\n          - [\"GAR-Dongre (mid)\", \"+0.20pp\", \"-0.25pp\", \"+0.68pp\", \"Yes\", \"Zero benefit supported\"]\n          - [\"GAR-ours (mid)\", \"+0.57pp\", \"+0.12pp\", \"+1.05pp\", \"No\", \"Tiny but significant positive\"]\n          - [\"PPL\", \"0.00\", \"-0.02\", \"+0.02\", \"Yes\", \"No PPL impact\"]\n    figures_description:\n      - \"Fig: Forest plot showing three paired differences (GAR-Dongre, GAR-ours, PPL) with 95% bootstrap CIs. GAR-Dongre and PPL CIs straddle zero; GAR-ours CI sits entirely in positive territory (barely). Dashed vertical line at zero for reference.\"\n    analysis: >\n      GAR-ours CI 不包含 0 是 worst tier 的一个 complication。虽然效应极小（0.57pp），但\n      统计上 reviewer 可以挑战 \"zero benefit\" 的绝对 claim。应对策略：(1) 论文主表使用\n      GAR-Dongre（与 Dongre 可比），在该口径下 CI 包含 0 → \"zero benefit\" 成立；\n      (2) 在 appendix 报告 GAR-ours 结果，acknowledge 微弱正效果但 argue effect size\n      过小（<1pp）to be practically meaningful；(3) 将叙事从 \"statistically zero\" 微调为\n      \"practically negligible, with statistically significant but sub-1pp effect under one of\n      two evaluation definitions\"。在 worst tier 下这增加了写作难度但不致命。\n\n  - name: \"Exposure-Bias Mitigation (Scheduled Sampling)\"\n    plan_id: \"plan_016\"\n    description: >\n      使用 scheduled sampling 训练 ThreadGate v7：训练过程中逐步混入 model-generated\n      context（替代 teacher-forced gold context），测试能否缩小 30x training-inference\n      GAR gap。Linear schedule: epoch 0 = 100% teacher-forcing, epoch 2 = 50%\n      model-generated。\n    expected_results:\n      training_gar_final: 0.31\n      training_gar_teacher_forced_final: 0.44\n      training_gar_model_generated_final: 0.18\n      inference_dongre_mid_gar: 0.0165\n      inference_ours_mid_gar: 0.0175\n      baseline_inference_dongre_mid_gar: 0.0152\n      baseline_inference_ours_mid_gar: 0.0157\n      gap_reduction_factor: 0.92\n      gap_original_ours: 30.6\n      gap_mitigated_ours: 17.7\n      gap_reduction_pct: 42\n      actual_inference_gar_improvement_pp: 0.18\n      ppl: 2.72\n      ppl_vs_baseline: -0.06\n      training_time_hours: 9.5\n      scheduled_sampling_final_ratio: 0.5\n    result_rationale: >\n      Worst tier 假设 scheduled sampling 不缩小 gap（或缩小 <20%）。但实际预测更微妙：\n      gap ratio 从 30.6x 缩小到 17.7x（看似 42% reduction），但这主要是因为 training GAR\n      从 0.48 下降到 0.31（分母变小），而 inference GAR 几乎不变（0.0157→0.0175，仅 +0.18pp）。\n      真正的问题是：scheduled sampling 确实让模型在 model-generated context 上 \"看到\" 了\n      更真实的训练分布，但 NTP loss 仍主导梯度，在 model-generated context 上 NTP 的梯度\n      更大（因为 PPL 更高），进一步压制 GAR 信号。结果是：模型在 mixed context 上训练的\n      GAR 低于纯 teacher-forcing（0.31 vs 0.48），但推理端改善几乎为零。\n      mitigation_gap_reduction_factor = 实际推理 GAR 改善 / 理论预期改善 ≈ 0.92（接近 1\n      意味着 gap 实际上没缩小；此处按 inference GAR 绝对值计算 0.0175/0.0157 = 1.11，\n      即仅 11% 的 inference GAR 改善）。这说明 exposure bias 的 mitigation 不是简单地\n      \"让模型看到 model-generated context\" 就能解决——NTP-GAR 梯度竞争在任何 context\n      分布下都存在，这是一个 orthogonal 的问题。\n    tables:\n      - name: \"Table: Scheduled Sampling Mitigation Results (Qwen-2.5-7B)\"\n        columns: [\"Metric\", \"Baseline (TG v7)\", \"Scheduled Sampling\", \"Change\"]\n        rows:\n          - [\"Training GAR (final)\", \"0.48\", \"0.31\", \"-0.17 (↓35%)\"]\n          - [\"Inference GAR-ours\", \"0.0157\", \"0.0175\", \"+0.18pp (↑11%)\"]\n          - [\"Inference GAR-Dongre\", \"0.0152\", \"0.0165\", \"+0.13pp (↑9%)\"]\n          - [\"Train-Infer Gap (ours)\", \"30.6x\", \"17.7x\", \"↓42% (misleading)\"]\n          - [\"PPL\", \"2.63\", \"2.72\", \"+0.09 (↑3.4%)\"]\n          - [\"Training Time\", \"5.9h\", \"9.5h\", \"+61% overhead\"]\n    figures_description:\n      - \"Fig: Two-panel comparison. Left: Training GAR curves for baseline (reaches 0.48) and scheduled sampling (reaches 0.31, with model-generated portions showing much lower GAR ~0.18). Right: Inference GAR comparison — two nearly overlapping bar clusters, with scheduled sampling showing marginal +0.18pp improvement. The visual message: training changes dramatically but inference barely moves.\"\n      - \"Fig: Decomposed training GAR by context type. Teacher-forced portions maintain GAR ~0.44; model-generated portions stabilize at ~0.18. The gap between these two within-training curves foreshadows the failure to close the training-inference gap.\"\n    analysis: >\n      Scheduled sampling 的 \"失败\" 在 worst tier 下有两层含义：(1) 实证层面，推理 GAR 仅\n      改善 0.18pp（从 0.0157 到 0.0175），在实际意义上 negligible——这验证了 mitigation\n      无效的假设；(2) 理论层面，这提供了重要的因果排除证据：如果 exposure bias 是 30x gap\n      的主因，scheduled sampling 应该实质性缩小 gap，但它没有 → exposure bias 不是唯一\n      因素，甚至可能不是主因。NTP-GAR 梯度竞争是一个 independent failure mechanism，\n      在任何 context 分布下都存在。这在 worst tier 叙事中变为 \"exposure bias 不是唯一因素\"\n      的证据，引入 architecture-specific confound。但这也削弱了 SP1 的核心卖点——如果\n      exposure bias 不是主因，那 \"exposure bias 的首个定量测量\" 的叙事价值下降。需要 reframe\n      SP1 为 \"distribution shift 和 gradient competition 的 entangled effects 的首个量化\"。\n```","stop_reason":"end_turn","session_id":"5f656fc9-3579-461d-a490-ffcd13e5ba84","total_cost_usd":0.48374225000000004,"usage":{"input_tokens":2,"cache_creation_input_tokens":20039,"cache_read_input_tokens":11841,"output_tokens":13499,"server_tool_use":{"web_search_requests":0,"web_fetch_requests":0},"service_tier":"standard","cache_creation":{"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":20039,"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0},"inference_geo":"","iterations":[{"input_tokens":2,"output_tokens":13499,"cache_read_input_tokens":11841,"cache_creation_input_tokens":20039,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":20039},"type":"message"}],"speed":"standard"},"modelUsage":{"claude-haiku-4-5-20251001":{"inputTokens":15003,"outputTokens":18,"cacheReadInputTokens":0,"cacheCreationInputTokens":0,"webSearchRequests":0,"costUSD":0.015093,"contextWindow":200000,"maxOutputTokens":32000},"claude-opus-4-6":{"inputTokens":2,"outputTokens":13499,"cacheReadInputTokens":11841,"cacheCreationInputTokens":20039,"webSearchRequests":0,"costUSD":0.46864925,"contextWindow":200000,"maxOutputTokens":64000}},"permission_denials":[],"terminal_reason":"completed","fast_mode_state":"off","uuid":"4cbb6c01-8559-4b77-89ac-04a36c2a18cd"}
